    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.5239868164062,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "may increase bedaquiline exposure or that of other agents with potential for cardiotoxicity when these",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972314834594727,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4365234375,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "are co-administered with antiretroviral drugs. However, because the data evaluated did not include",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3902587890625,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "information on changes to the regimen as a result of management of adverse drug reactions, or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4354248046875,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "complications from drug–drug interactions, the GDG reiterated that it is worth paying attention to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.5852661132812,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "any potential drug–drug interactions or overlapping drug toxicities that may not have been captured.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983838081359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.3870239257812,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "For example, bedaquiline concentrations can be reduced by efavirenz (these drugs should not be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.5657348632812,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "co-administered) or increased by boosted protease inhibitors (resulting in a need for greater vigilance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97652530670166,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        158.5147247314453,
        524.2591552734375,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "(56–58) in monitoring for drug-related QT effects)  . Neuropathy, liver enzyme elevations and CNS side-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.968755722045898,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.71473693847656,
        385.5888977050781,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "(59) effects can be attributed to HIV or TB drugs or their interactions  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.8345489501953,
        207.4549102783203,
        219.49453735351562
      ],
      "text": "Children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.42640686035156,
        527.413818359375,
        241.14540100097656
      ],
      "text": "n The datasets included only small numbers of people aged below 15 years ( =69), and thus did not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        238.6265411376953,
        527.4161987304688,
        254.3455352783203
      ],
      "text": "n n allow for reliable comparisons in both datasets from South Africa ( =69 and  =7) and in the 2021 IPD",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.979931831359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.82643127441406,
        527.1949462890625,
        267.5454406738281
      ],
      "text": "n ( =7). However, analysis in the subgroup aged below 15 years showed a relative increase in treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.976223945617676,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.30242919921875,
        527.5442504882812,
        280.7454528808594
      ],
      "text": "success of 42% (aRR=1.42, 95% CI: 0.7 to 2.89) in sub-PICO 1.1 and a 5% relative reduction (RR=0.95,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983887672424316,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.50238037109375,
        527.4421997070312,
        293.9454040527344
      ],
      "text": "95% CI: 0.78 to 1.15) in sub-PICO 1.2. Although a small number of participants were aged between",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        292.702392578125,
        527.4134521484375,
        307.1454162597656
      ],
      "text": "10 and 15 years (19/50, 38% in the intervention group, and 75/162, 46% in the comparator group),",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        305.90252685546875,
        527.2191162109375,
        320.3455505371094
      ],
      "text": "extrapolation of the findings to children was deemed reasonable for efficacy because components of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994749069213867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.1024169921875,
        527.381591796875,
        333.5454406738281
      ],
      "text": "the regimen had been used safely in children based on other available data regarding linezolid use",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        332.3023986816406,
        527.4202270507812,
        346.74542236328125
      ],
      "text": "in children. This extrapolation was considered applicable to children of all ages, taking into account",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.2264099121094,
        439.5531005859375,
        359.9454345703125
      ],
      "text": "(30) the recommendation for use of bedaquiline in children aged below 6 years  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.3463134765625,
        266.2093505859375,
        392.0063171386719
      ],
      "text": "Pregnant and breastfeeding women",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.2142028808594,
        527.3056030273438,
        413.6572265625
      ],
      "text": "In the research studies analysed, pregnant women were not identified, and subgroup data were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        412.4142150878906,
        527.6124877929688,
        426.85723876953125
      ],
      "text": "unavailable. Ethionamide is usually contraindicated in pregnancy (because animal reproduction studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957266807556152,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.61431884765625,
        527.447509765625,
        440.0573425292969
      ],
      "text": "have shown an adverse effect on the fetus and there are no adequate and well-controlled studies in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.814208984375,
        527.392578125,
        453.2572326660156
      ],
      "text": "humans), and this is the main reason that the 9-month regimen has not been recommended for this",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.7381896972656,
        527.4158935546875,
        466.45721435546875
      ],
      "text": "(60, 61) subgroup in the past. There is experience in using linezolid during pregnancy  . For pregnant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.2142028808594,
        527.40234375,
        479.6572265625
      ],
      "text": "and breastfeeding women, it is therefore recommended to use the regimen with linezolid instead of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.4142150878906,
        130.77207946777344,
        492.85723876953125
      ],
      "text": "ethionamide.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        509.25811767578125,
        174.74769592285156,
        524.9181518554688
      ],
      "text": "Extrapulmonary TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.1260986328125,
        527.3688354492188,
        546.569091796875
      ],
      "text": "A subgroup of people with extrapulmonary TB were included in the research studies (81 in the regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95405387878418,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        545.3260498046875,
        527.177001953125,
        559.76904296875
      ],
      "text": "containing linezolid and 23 in the regimen with ethionamide). In view of the unavailability of evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98819351196289,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        558.526123046875,
        527.4488525390625,
        572.9691162109375
      ],
      "text": "on surrogates for severity or extent of disease, the use of this regimen in patients with severe forms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        571.72607421875,
        270.7998962402344,
        586.1690673828125
      ],
      "text": "of extrapulmonary TB is not recommended.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.5432739257812,
        245.23455810546875,
        615.3953247070312
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        631.7432250976562,
        213.38893127441406,
        647.4032592773438
      ],
      "text": "Drug susceptibility testing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.611083984375,
        527.4321899414062,
        669.0540771484375
      ],
      "text": "DST for bedaquiline and linezolid is an important implementation consideration that will need to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        667.8110961914062,
        527.3372802734375,
        682.2540893554688
      ],
      "text": "be enhanced in many countries, given the increasing use of these medicines in all regimens for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        681.0111083984375,
        527.2584228515625,
        695.4541015625
      ],
      "text": "MDR/RR-TB and the possible further inclusion of new medicines in MDR-TB treatment regimens.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        694.2111206054688,
        527.3946533203125,
        708.6541137695312
      ],
      "text": "The implementation of these recommendations must be accompanied by continued efforts to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.4111328125,
        527.4246215820312,
        721.8541259765625
      ],
      "text": "increase access to DST for all medicines for which reliable methods are currently available, and for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        720.611083984375,
        384.54437255859375,
        735.0540771484375
      ],
      "text": "the development and roll-out of DST methods for newer medicines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.3151245117188,
        527.4017944335938,
        756.7581176757812
      ],
      "text": "Access to WHO-recommended rapid DST is essential, especially for detecting resistance to rifampicin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986891746520996,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        755.5150146484375,
        527.4379272460938,
        769.9580078125
      ],
      "text": "and fluoroquinolones, before starting the 9-month regimens. Baseline DST will confirm eligibility for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "96 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
